msgid "HIL 与实板状态"
msgstr "HIL and physical-board status"

msgid ""
"当前没有接入可执行的 MCU 实板、调试探针或串口。F407ZG 启明、F407VE 天空星、 F470ZG 梁山派，以及 G474／H743／U575"
" 来源参考切片的物理状态均为 `not_executed`。 准备工装、成功生成计划或通过 host validator，不是 MCU "
"上实际完成的实验。"
msgstr ""
"No executable MCU boards, debug probes or serial ports are currently "
"connected. Physical status for F407ZG Qiming, F407VE Sky Star, F470ZG "
"Liangshan, and the G474/H743/U575 source-reference slices is `not_executed`."
" Prepared tooling, a successfully generated plan or a passing host validator"
" is not an experiment actually performed on an MCU."

msgid "待执行范围"
msgstr "Pending execution scope"

msgid "已有入口"
msgstr "Existing entry"

msgid "尚缺的真实证据"
msgstr "Real evidence still needed"

msgid "三块首发板与芯片参考配置"
msgstr "Three initial boards and chip-reference configurations"

msgid ""
"[支持记录](../delivery/support.md)、[通用 HIL 准备](../guides/performance-hil.md)"
msgstr ""
"[Support records](../delivery/support.md), [general HIL "
"preparation](../guides/performance-hil.md)"

msgid "PCB、探针、供电、晶振、接线与 station admission"
msgstr "PCB, probe, supply, oscillator, wiring and station admission"

msgid "UART／SPI／ADC／Flash 等实际模式"
msgstr "Actual UART/SPI/ADC/Flash and other modes"

msgid "[资格合同](../delivery/qualification.md)"
msgstr "[Qualification contract](../delivery/qualification.md)"

msgid "IRQ、DMA、线完成、取消排空、过载、掉电原始 traces"
msgstr ""
"Raw traces for IRQ, DMA, wire completion, cancellation drain, overload and "
"power loss"

msgid "OS49–OS55"
msgstr "OS49–OS55"

msgid "[OS 原记录](../delivery/os.md)、[逐项 OS 台账](ledgers/os.md)"
msgstr ""
"[Original OS records](../delivery/os.md), [per-task OS "
"ledger](ledgers/os.md)"

msgid "IRQ→task、寄存器保持、栈峰值、Tick、满载退出、睡眠与异常响应"
msgstr ""
"IRQ-to-task, register retention, stack peaks, Tick, full-load shutdown, "
"sleep and fault response"

msgid "H743 Cache／DMA、U575 双域"
msgstr "H743 Cache/DMA and U575 security domains"

msgid "[SoC 扩展记录](../delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md)"
msgstr "[SoC extension records](../delivery/soc-extensions-verification.md)"

msgid "精确电源／option bytes 与真实硬件执行、隔离和失败观测"
msgstr ""
"Exact supply/option bytes and actual hardware execution, isolation and "
"failure observations"

msgid "cycles、latency、power、WCET"
msgstr "cycles、latency、power、WCET"

msgid "[后续迭代](roadmap.md)"
msgstr "[Later iterations](roadmap.md)"

msgid "同一 candidate、仪器、负载与明确预算的实际测量"
msgstr ""
"Actual measurements with the same candidate, instruments, load and explicit "
"budgets"

msgid ""
"OS 计划保持 `prepared_unbound`，物理状态保持 `not_executed`。真实执行必须先满足 station "
"admission，并提供准确 workload、instrument、raw trace、时间和目标身份。 禁止给 unbound 计划填写 "
"`passed` 来代替 acquisition。"
msgstr ""
"OS plans remain `prepared_unbound`; physical status remains `not_executed`. "
"Real execution first requires station admission and an accurate workload, "
"instrument, raw trace, time and target identity. Do not enter `passed` on an"
" unbound plan as a substitute for acquisition."

msgid "首次实板验收顺序"
msgstr "First physical-board acceptance sequence"

msgid "核对具体 PCB、option bytes、电气条件、安全初值与 clock，不猜接线。"
msgstr ""
"Check the exact PCB, option bytes, electrical conditions, safe initial "
"levels and clock; do not guess wiring."

msgid "将真实 probe、serial 与需要的 waveform／power-cut 仪器绑定到 station。"
msgstr ""
"Bind actual probes, serial ports and required waveform/power-cut instruments"
" to the station."

msgid "固定源码、resolved 配置、工具和 candidate ELF；采用实际预算。"
msgstr ""
"Fix the source, resolved configuration, tools and candidate ELF; use actual "
"budgets."

msgid "执行对应模式的原始采集与失败路径，保留每次失败和重试。"
msgstr ""
"Acquire raw observations and exercise failure paths for the selected mode, "
"retaining every failure and retry."

msgid "对同一 tuple 做资格判断。没有执行的 controller、mode 或板卡保持未执行。"
msgstr ""
"Assess qualification for that exact tuple. Controllers, modes or boards not "
"executed remain unexecuted."

msgid ""
"工具源码入口见 [实现地图](../development/implementation-map.md)。物理 scope "
"仅在真实站点执行后升级，不能因文档发布、软件 CI 或片上单元存在自动升级。"
msgstr ""
"Tool source entry points are in the [implementation "
"map](../development/implementation-map.md). Physical scope advances only "
"after execution at a real station, never because of documentation "
"publication, software CI or on-chip capability."
